  "description": {
   "en": "“I’ll do my best. When I’m with you, oppa.”\n\n“Oppa… I really don’t have the courage, but…”\n“What is it? Just say it.”\n“Would you sleep with me?”\n\nIs it okay to make such a request to my friend’s older brother?\nBut… if not today, if it’s not Jang Tae-gyeom…\n\n“I’ll do my best. When I’m with you, oppa.”"
  },
